Email from Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC Showing 75216 - Check out our newest available opportunity!   CLICK HERE for Additional Pictures & Videos   Showing this Week! Call or Text (214) 646-9646﻿ 2303 Stovall Dr, Dallas, TX 75216 BEDROOMS: 2 | BATHROOMS: 1 BUILT: 1949 | SQFT: 768 | Lot: 0.15 Acres **ARV: $250,000+ *Your Opportunity: $87,500 ASK FOR PREMIUM HML & DSCR F﻿INANCING GET YOUR MONEY OUT OF YOUR DEALS IN 30-60 DAYS NO SEASONING PERIOD Tell Bill that Fazio Sent You Prime Cedar Crest Value-Add Opportunity Minutes from Downtown Dallas, Bishop Arts District, and the Dallas VA Medical Center. Excellent access to I-35E, I-45, Loop 12, DART Rail, and major employment hubs supports strong rental demand. ﻿Roof: No Known Issues HVAC: No Known Issues Plumbing: No Known Issues Electrical: No Known Issues Foundation: No Known Issues Recent Sales: 2503 Stovall Dr, Dallas, TX 75216 Beds: 2 | Bath: 1 (1 0) | SqFt: 768 Sold For: $259,000 | Price/SqFt: $337.24 Listing ID: 20906835 ﻿ 1726 Marfa Ave, Dallas, TX 75216 Beds: 2 | Bath: 1 (1 0) | SqFt: 796 Sold For: $233,000 | Price/SqFt: $292.71 Listing ID: 20875011 2319 Village Way, Dallas, TX 75216 Beds: 2 | Bath: 1 (1 0) | SqFt: 800 Sold For: $200,000 | Price/SqFt: $250.00 Listing ID: 20881781 ﻿Always Do Due Diligence MOC FILED ON PROPERTY by Team Delivered Vacant﻿ ﻿Contact Us Selling equitable interest/contract rights only; not the property owner.﻿ CLICK FOR PREMIUM HML & DSCR F﻿INANCING PRIVATE INVENTORY JOIN OUR VIP LIST CLICK HERE for Additional Pictures & Videos   If you have any questions or would like to schedule a viewing, call, text or email me! Jade Vaughn | 214.646.9646 Jade@faziorealestatesolutions.com Let's Get You That Deal! For More Info or To Make An Offer Contact: Close Date: Contact for Details Agents, please add commission on top of the asking price. This is an assignment of contract for equitable interest.   Call or Text (214) 646-9646 Call, Text, Or Email Us for More Info! **ALL INFORMATION DEEMED RELIABLE PLEASE DO YOUR OWN DUE DILIGENCE ARV IS ONLY AN ESTIMATE, NOT GUARANTEED Terms & Conditions: Close Date: ASAP Cash or Hard Money Only Property is being sold AS-IS Buyer pays their closing costs Non-Refundable Earnest Money Required Agents & Wholesalers, please add your commission to the sale price Call or Text Bill at (833) 628-3863 SFR | MFR | Land | & Commercial Investment Opportunities Have a property you need to liquidate immediately? We partner with other investors in the DFW, Houston, San Antonio, and Austin areas. For more information, reply to this email with details about the property you need help liquidating for a same-day contract/offer. Reach out today! Wholesalers | Investors | Agents | Sellers Know someone who needs to $ell? Refer them to us and if we close with them you'll get a credit towards your next investment with us!   If you have any questions or would like to schedule a viewing, call or email me. Niccolo Fazio Niccolo@Faziorealestatesolutions.com Not the right deal for you? Give me a call and let us tailor our next deal for you. Click below to get started! Let's Get You That Deal!   Share This Email Share This Email Share This Email         Disclaimer: House is being sold as-is. Buyer to pay for all standard closing costs. All offers on properties require up to $7,500 non-refundable earnest money deposit. Agents will add their fee on top of any asking price which will be reflected on the contract. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC does not claim to be the owner of the properties we market for sale. All properties are subject to errors, omissions, deletions, additions, cancellations. All properties sold as is, where is with absolutely no representations written or oral. Buyer is to do their own independent due diligence. Property will not be considered under contract until the signed contract and deposit are received with all contingencies removed. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC is a real estate investment firm. *This is a private and confidential communication that should not be shared with any other person or party. Violation of this will result in the recipient being removed from our exclusive email list. IMPORTANT -This e-mail and any files transmitted with it are private and confidential and are solely for the use of the addressee. It may contain material that is legally privileged. If you are not the addressee or the person responsible for delivering to the addressee, be advised that you have received this e-mail in error and that any use of it is strictly prohibited. CONSUMER ALERT ** PLEASE READ THE FOLLOWING ** Due to the recent rise in cyber crime sweeping the real estate industry, we want you to be aware of the following important information: There have been many instances of real estate agents', brokers', attorneys', and/or consumers' e-mail addresses being hacked/phished. The cyber-criminals forward bogus wire instructions, redirecting deposits and/or cash to close to a fraudulent bank account. Once received, the money is quickly sent offshore, where it is difficult if not impossible to retrieve. If someone representing Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC or any other party involved in a transaction you have with this company sends you wire instructions, CALL OUR OFFICE IMMEDIATELY BEFORE SENDING ANY FUNDS. DO NOT SEND AN E-MAIL. We will never ask you to send wires to any other person or entity. LICENSE HOLDER DISCLOSURE: Texas law requires a real estate license holder who is a party to a transaction or acting on behalf of a spouse, parent, child, business entity in which the license holder owns more than 10% or a trust for which the license holder acts as the trustee or of which the license holder or the license holder’s spouse, parent or the child is a beneficiary, to notify the other party in writing before entering into a contract of sale. Disclose if applicable: Niccolo Fazio is a licensed real estate agent in the state of Texas. All Parties engaging in a transaction with Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC acknowledge that Niccolo Fazio is a real estate agent, however, Niccolo Fazio is not representing any party involved in any transaction. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC nor Niccolo Fazio does not represent you as your real estate agent in any capacity of a transaction unless agreed upon by all parties in writing. REGARDING ASSIGNMENT CONTRACTS: EQUITABLE INTEREST DISCLOSURE PURSUANT TO TEXAS PROPERTY CODE SEC. 5.086: THIS INSTRUMENT REPRESENTS ONLY AN OPTION OR ASSIGNMENT OF AN INTEREST IN REAL PROPERTY. IT IS NOT A TRANSFER OF TITLE. THE ASSIGNOR DOES NOT HAVE LEGAL TITLE TO THE PROPERTY. CONSULT AN ATTORNEY PRIOR TO EXECUTION IF YOU DO NOT UNDERSTAND THIS DISCLOSURE. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC or any other party involved in a transaction does not claim to be the owner of the properties of the contracts that we market for sale. If we are not the owner(s) then we simply have an equitable interest in the property. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC or any other party involved in a transaction is a real estate investment firm and does not claim to be licensed real estate agents or brokers therefore we are not providing representation of the seller(s). Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC or any other party involved in a transaction will assign to the buyer equitable interest. The assignment will be initiated upon reaching a purchase agreement and deposit received. The deposit will be refunded if only the seller doesn’t perform and/or the title does not clear within a reasonable amount of time. The contracted closing is only extended if the title is not deemed clear and all involved parties agree to the extension. All above-stated information, including any projected after-repair values and estimated repairs, is a matter of personal opinion and therefore should be verified independently by the buyer. Always perform your own due diligence to verify and validate any numbers presented before signing a contract or assignment to purchase any property. Referral Fee Disclosure Statement (Texas Real Estate Commission Rule §535.148 & Federal RESPA Compliance) Notice: Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC (“we,” “our,” or “us”) may receive a marketing or referral fee from RCN Capital, NATFUNDING F/C, or other lenders/service providers mentioned in this communication if you choose to work with them. You are under no obligation to use any lender or service provider we mention. You are free to shop for the best services and terms that meet your needs. This disclosure is provided in the interest of full transparency and compliance with applicable Texas Real Estate Commission rules and federal law. All materials available on our website and provided by Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC are samples and are for informational purposes only. Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC does not provide legal advice. Although we go to great lengths to make sure our information is accurate and useful, we recommend you consult a lawyer if you want professional assurance that our information, and your interpretation of it, is appropriate to your particular situation. You are solely responsible for ensuring that your business practices comply with all applicable, local, state & federal laws. *This is a private and confidential communication that should not be shared with any other person or party. Violation of this will result in the recipient being removed from our exclusive email list. This is the price to purchase our equitable interest in the property, and established contract with the seller. CONSULT AN ATTORNEY PRIOR TO EXECUTION IF YOU DO NOT UNDERSTAND ANY DISCLOSURES OR CONTRACTS.   Fazio Real Estate Solutions, LLC | Dallas | Dallas, TX 75093 US Unsubscribe | Update Profile | Our Privacy Policy | Constant Contact Data Notice
